{"synopsis":"Seorang pria pengangguran melarikan diri dari kehidupannya yang membosankan melalui game God Forsaken World—sampai suatu hari, dia terbangun di dalam game tersebut sebagai pangeran ketiga yang dipermalukan dan kelebihan berat badan, Gillosyan Elo de Balt. Hanya beberapa saat setelah terbunuh, dia kini harus bertahan hidup menggunakan satu-satunya kelebihan yang dimilikinya: panduan strategi rahasia dari pengetahuan gamernya. Bergabung dengan seorang ksatria setia dan mentor sihir yang kuat, dia menghadapi dunia yang keras dan tidak dapat diprediksi di mana bertahan sebagai “pangeran pecundang” bukanlah hal yang mudah.\n\nFantasi aksi bertahan hidup yang mendebarkan dimulai ketika aturan permainan tidak lagi berlaku.","alternative_title":"초월급 엑스트라의 공략집 (2025)","author":"Coldcat","artist":"VIK","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"61eb47cd-ed1b-4602-a76e-01028957adb3","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2026-05-26","released":"2026-05-26"},{"chapter_id":"4594c907-4133-4436-b553-d527d69f8710","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2026-05-24","released":"2026-05-24"},{"chapter_id":"1ce4963f-c45d-4da4-bf53-2bd045ba9103","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2026-05-22","released":"2026-05-22"},{"chapter_id":"114a8ddf-aadc-4606-96eb-c09604bb833a","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2026-05-12","released":"2026-05-12"},{"chapter_id":"a6144c54-c343-4063-891e-aff95d9a3397","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"","date":"2026-04-15","released":"2026-04-15"},{"chapter_id":"30f569ed-5507-4ca2-8b4f-d08487caad54","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"","date":"2026-04-04","released":"2026-04-04"},{"chapter_id":"ade0208a-d016-438c-90e7-651fcff06825","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"","date":"2026-03-31","released":"2026-03-31"},{"chapter_id":"0dd1ad96-4cc8-421f-afde-a262f9106b8a","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"","date":"2026-03-25","released":"2026-03-25"},{"chapter_id":"c589c72c-c4a7-44e3-acdd-15588caf7de0","number":"40",